    ]
  },
  "StockRole": "Sniper",
  "YangsThoughts": "This one's built to hang back and pick its shots. That ER PPC hits hard from a long way off, and the TAG tells the artillery exactly where to drop its shells, so you won't be doing all the work yourself. There's an ER Small Laser for anything that slips in close, and if things still get too hot, the Supercharger will get you out of trouble a lot quicker than anyone expects from a forty-tonner. Just keep an eye on your heat.",
